  "id": 203719430351407,
  "uuid": "b37aa345-a0e2-4f36-8f06-eb425ca5324d",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "504a4ef2-db50-06b2-795d-c240509fdf49",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "ea880420-ad2e-7554-40a7-c1cae76079ac",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We spoke to some of AKU-SONAM's Bachelor of Science in Nursing students based in Kenya about the significance of International Nurses Day to them this year, and they shared some of their responses:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "George Magembe, Nurse In-charge of the Medical-Surgical Ward at Metropolitan Hospital:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " \"Many professions are being replaced by technology but as a nurse, I cannot be replaced because I offer very essentials services. We empathize with those who are hurt, care for them when they are sick and when they get better we rejoice with them. As a nurse, I live to empower others. Happy International Nurses Day!\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Nancy Mongina Abuya, Nurse at Pumwani Maternity Hospital:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " \"Nursing is the most rewarding, diverse and flexible career. I like nursing because I learn new things every day and it encourages me to think outside the box to handle different situations. Happy International Nurses Day to everyone!\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Michael Thuo Muriithi, Nurse at the Defence Forces Memorial Hospital:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " \"As a Critical Care nurse, I work on the frontline to enable patients who are severely ill to have a new lease of life. I am their advocate who is always there for them.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Lillian Emojong, Nurse at the Kenyatta National Hospital:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " \"I wear several hats in my daily practice as a nurse. What I love most about these many hats is that each of them involves experiences with patient care, which is priceless. Happy International Nurses Day!\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruth Wanjiku Mbagu, Nurse at Parklands Kidney Centre:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " \"Nursing has made me a lifelong learner and being part of a great team gives me joy and happiness every day. Happy International Nurses Day to all my nursing colleagues!\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Next time you see a nurse, be sure to tell them \"Thank you\".",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
